<title>SINGAPORE: Asian rice prices - February 20.</title>
<headline>Asian rice prices - February 20.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rice prices quoted on Thursday by trading and official sources in the key producing nations of Thailand, Vietnam and India in U.S. dollars a tonne:</p>
<p>							     Feb 20     Feb 13</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct white B benchmark FOB Bangkok 360-390   370-390</p>
<p>Thailand-100 pct fragrant rice FOB Bangkok     620-630   620-630</p>
<p>India-5.0 pct broken(non-Basmati long grain) FOB 290	 290</p>
<p>India-10 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	275-285     280</p>
<p>India-15 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  245	 245</p>
<p>India-25 pct broken FOB (west coast port)	  235	 230</p>
<p>Vietnam-5.0 percent broken FOB Saigon port	 270	 270</p>
<p>Vietnam-10 percent broken FOB Saigon port	  265	 260</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703305)</p>
</text>
